  "solution": "The logic/rule followed here is,\n\n**(2nd Number - 1st Number) × 10**\n\n3*1 = 20 → (3** -** 1) **× 10 **= 20\n\n6*1 = 50 → (6** -** 1) **× 10** = 50\n\n2*6 = -40 → (2** -** 6) **× 10** = -40\n\nSimilarly,\n\n5*8 → (5** -** 8) **× 10** = -30\n\nHence, the correct answer is **‘-30’.**",
